            {
              "type": "text",
              "align": "center",
              "size": "md",
              "marginBottom": "var(--space-4)",
              "text": "We're excited to welcome both new and returning members to the WCAA New Jersey & Southeastern Pennsylvania Chapter. Our local community brings together window covering professionals who value education, collaboration, and connection within the industry."
